<title>SPAIN: POLL - BCH H1 net attributable seen up 21.8%.</title>
<headline>POLL - BCH H1 net attributable seen up 21.8%.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for first-half results for Spain's Banco Central Hispano. Numbers in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   H1 97	  H1 96	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income   151.05	 140.39   148.00-158.64</p>
<p>    Operating income	 67.50	  51.41    63.60-78.04</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 24.87	  20.42    23.58-26.54</p>
<p>NOTE - The group will release results on July 24.</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Benito y Monjardin, Inverban, AB Asesores, Ahorro Corporacion, Beta Capital.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +3 41 585 2167</p>
